  Example queries fully supported today:

  - "Alice updated Area 42 at 10:15, resulting in version 7" — reconstructable from area_version where area_id = 42, version = 7, change_type = UPDATED, created_by = alice_id, created_at = 10:15.
  - "What areas did user X modify this week?" — SELECT * FROM area_version WHERE created_by = ? AND created_at > ?.
  - "Show the full history of Area 42 ordered newest first" — SELECT * FROM area_version WHERE area_id = 42 ORDER BY version DESC.
  - "What was the Area geometry before Bob deleted it?" — the DELETED version row contains the snapshot.

  All canonical audit questions for Area mutations are fully answerable from the current schema without additional tables.

